  "body": "[To unload a document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#unload-a-document) should clear [the list of scripts that will execute when the document has finished parsing](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#list-of-scripts-that-will-execute-when-the-document-has-finished-parsing).\r\n\r\nAlternatively, when the user agent [stops parsing the document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#stop-parsing) runs the deferred scripts, it should be checking that the document had not been unloaded.\r\n\r\nThis is the behavior of WebKit & Firefox whereas Chrome seems to follow the current spec.",
